  "translation": "Na i kamap, taim olgeta king bilong ol Emori, ol i stap long narapela sait bilong Jordan go daun long sait bilong solwara, na olgeta king bilong ol Kenani, ol i stap klostu long solwara, i harim ⟨את⟩ olsem Yahwe i draim ⟨את⟩ wara bilong Jordan naunau long ol pikinini bilong Yisrael, inap taim ol i go pastaim, na ol bel bilong ol i mash i go daun, na i no gat ruak moa namel long ol, olsem bilong ol pikinini bilong Yisrael.",
